---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Photo credits
section: credits
---
<section class="container-x max-w-5xl py-14">
  <p class="eyebrow">Credits</p>
  <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Photo credits</h1>
  <p class="lead mt-4">
    Drive Moris is a fictional company created by Webmoris as a demo. All photos come from
    <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/" class="text-lagoon-700 underline" rel="noopener noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons</a>
    and are used under the licences below. They have been resized and cropped for this website.
    Car models appear for illustration only; no carmaker is connected with this demo.
  </p>
  <ul class="mt-12 divide-y divide-line border-y border-line">
    {% asyncEach key, photo in photos %}
      <li class="flex flex-col gap-4 py-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center">
        <div class="h-16 w-28 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg">{% picture key, "", "144px", { widths: [480] } %}</div>
        <div class="text-sm">
          <p class="font-semibold text-ink-900">“{{ photo.title }}”</p>
          <p class="text-ink-500">by {{ photo.author }} ·
            {% if photo.licenseUrl %}<a href="{{ photo.licenseUrl }}" class="underline hover:text-lagoon-700" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ photo.license }}</a>{% else %}{{ photo.license }}{% endif %}
            · <a href="{{ photo.source }}" class="underline hover:text-lagoon-700" rel="noopener noreferrer">source</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </li>
    {% endeach %}
  </ul>
  <h2 class="mt-12 text-2xl">Map data</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-ink-700">The map and the coast route are drawn from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright" class="text-lagoon-700 underline" rel="noopener noreferrer">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a>, available under the Open Database Licence. The route follows the coastline and is approximate.</p>
</section>
